	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Cherry MX style, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 6.25u (courtyard 119.01x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used. For Kailh Choc 1350 (V1) stabilizers use the _ChocV1Stab variant.")
